"video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SoarTour", "keywords": ["flight", "travel", "sightseeing", "wingsuit", "earth"], "long_description": "SoarTour lets you fly freely over real cities and landscapes all around the world in VR.\n\nCHOOSE WHERE TO GO\n- Spin the globe and tap a spot, or pick from 45 featured places such as Tokyo, Paris, New York, Mount Fuji and the Grand Canyon. You arrive in the sky with the landmark right in front of you.\n- Search any place or address by voice or keyboard. Recent searches are saved.\n\nFLY WITH CONTROLLERS\n- Super jump: hop lightly in place to shoot up into the sky\n- Thrust: pull the trigger to fire jets from your controllers\n- Glide: spread your arms to glide like a bird\n- Climb and dive: raise or lower both arms while gliding\n- Turn: raise one arm and lower the other\n\nFLY WITH YOUR HANDS\n- Make two loose fists and a yoke appears in front of you\n- Press your thumbs to fly forward, push or pull the yoke to dive or climb, and tilt it to turn\n\nREAL CITYSCAPES\nBuildings and terrain stream in from real-world 3D map data as you fly, with the names of stations and landmarks floating over the city.\n\nMAKE IT YOURS\n- Time of day and season, from cherry blossoms to snow\n- An apocalypse mode that turns the city into ruins\n- A selfie camera for photos and videos\n\nPLEASE NOTE\n- Internet required. Map data loads as you fly.\n- Voice search uses the microphone. Japanese and English are supported.\n- Up to 30 warps per day, since each warp uses paid map and voice services.\n- Play standing in a clear space.\n- Includes flying and falling. If you are new to VR, start with short sessions.", "short_description": "Fly anywhere on Earth. Spin the globe, pick one of 45 famous places or search any address by voice or keyboard, then soar over real 3D cityscapes. Fly with controllers or just your hands: grab a virtual yoke, or hop into the sky, spread your arms and glide like a bird around landmarks you have only ever seen from the ground."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://onaca.jp/privacypolicy-us", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://onaca.jp/soartour-terms", "publisher_name": "Onacasoft Co., Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://onaca.jp/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ja"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "41487793394153057"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593877129_2226409298758829_7559981008195784420_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iaTLKPsNNQYQ7kNvwHThya-&_nc_oc=Adrnq_6_n_Hpm0dKUM6KJm5dIPcNVh2B7Usw7Z-pJ8u5ANckH2ytzv2iIRMwYw-U3LQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX10CVNzlbzPjKu8YhOUiHRd_aKrNpYxCTdqOKYngMxmQ&oe=6B0F1D27"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "SoarTour", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "362692211442873"}, "context_topics": [{"topic_name": "Travel & Exploration", "id": "726368587961803"}], "release_date": 1795695000, "lastRevision": {"nodes": [{"id": "40994950216770713", "release_type": "SCHEDULED", "administration_status": "APPROVED", "pdp_metadata": {"application": {"default_locale": "en_US", "id": "40994950066770728", "is_first_party": false, "enables_in_app