6", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593822060_1862388234942169_1412215739480642881_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QFm9LlbBpdcQ7kNvwGEfJJe&_nc_oc=AdoqjLpbkI8tBtAlmfS9ryDaXrIZk6mJTEBE9C4kC5RgMYblsdfthI7LsvsuXjUdOuc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVSZvFGzuVVci0Tote9UPzzkmqXrtWWNl4qcOTucHuCDA&oe=6B0F2131"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-3-big-ben.png", "id": "1880619389780990", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628455_1880619393114323_7644292781641013448_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Q9YZYLYFPdwQ7kNvwFbXyKR&_nc_oc=AdptC3CYKQCA6fGvlRyXDqHu6S-Ns_NYMJDKjv0iPxGo1gpbxnWegexL_IzPlXWq8Ug&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQUhdN5K5f_hHCGkeQ7I8Ylh-bIalmeMt3UJKSYDz7Ecaw&oe=6B0F1833"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-2-golden-gate.png", "id": "2133766613892432", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628456_2133766617225765_5976908390184331674_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JZzg-eSpHJoQ7kNvwHQPSX0&_nc_oc=AdoOaAnoQpb0vk7nJ3EVKUk4aX7X7KcZeGuC6AD2OsONsKMBpc51hmUqMehoyNkmuYQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQW4eqIGFjTVS8odbN9Z-37QzRRrQ5W6QTTMTqbJRKZClw&oe=6B0EFF5D"}, {"file_name": "screenshot-5-mt-fuji.png", "id": "1645210163774210", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628882_1645210167107543_8990526472650854968_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VbPFAhVhtjgQ7kNvwGWB7MX&_nc_oc=AdrxBs4BziXa4iXxp2GE0sUKWNVIvlu393_LPYgf8tn0jSzerJqREDRM-adLiy8lwWM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVT4YtGKd0xFYx7H1MbIZ9fcdq9_x2NZhpTMdsbozyz7A&oe=6B0F199B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "SoarTour", "keywords": ["flight", "travel", "sightseeing", "wingsuit", "earth"], "long_description": "SoarTour lets you fly freely over real cities all around the world in VR.\n\nSAY WHERE YOU WANT TO GO\nHold the middle-finger grip, say a place such as \"Tokyo Tower\" or \"Eiffel Tower\", and release. You warp into the sky above it. Famous sights or your own hometown, if it is on the map, you can fly there.\n\nFLY WITH YOUR BODY\n- Super jump: hop lightly in place to shoot up into the sky\n- Thrust: pull the trigger to fire jets from your controllers\n- Glide: spread your arms out to the sides to glide like a bird\n- Climb and dive: while gliding, raise both arms to climb and lower them to dive\n- Turn: raise one arm and lower the other to bank and turn\n\nREAL CITYSCAPES\nBuildings and terrain stream in from real-world 3D map data as you fly. See familiar streets from angles you have never seen before.\n\nMAKE IT YOURS\n- Time of day: day, evening or night\n- Fall speed: slow, normal or realistic\n- Recenter your view and set a play-time limit\n\nPLEASE NOTE\n- An internet connection is required. Map data loads as you fly, so it may take a moment to appear on slower connections.\n- Choosing a destination by voice uses the microphone. Japanese and English are supported.\n- Up to 30 warps per day.\n- You move your whole body while playing. Play standing, with plenty of clear space around you.\n- The game includes flying and falling. If you are new to VR, start with short sessions.", "short_description": "Say a place, soar anywhere. Speak the name of any spot on Earth and warp into the sky above it, then fly over real 3D cityscapes with your own body. Jump to launch, spread your arms to glide like a bird, and circle landmarks you have only ever seen from the ground."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://onaca.jp/privacypolicy-us", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Onacasoft Co., Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://onaca.jp/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFO